{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"776","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"碳交易奏效 德國碳排年減7%","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">最新更新：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020/01/08 08:56</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E5%BE%B7%E5%9C%8B%E6%B8%9B%E7%A2%B3.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">再生能源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年可滿足德國全國用電量的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">42.6%</span>。圖為德國能源供應企業安能（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">EnBW</span>）位於波羅的海的離岸風場<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Baltic 2</span>。（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">EnBW/J&ouml;rn Tirgrath</span>提供）中央社記者林育立柏林傳真<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span>&nbsp;</span>108</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>日</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">（中央社記者林育立柏林<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>日專電）歐洲實施碳交易制度，增加燃煤發電成本，成功發揮減碳的效果，德國的碳排量在去年減少了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7%</span>，朝減碳目標邁進。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">柏林能源轉型智庫<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Agora Energiewende</span>今天公布年度報告，由於再生能源成長和碳交易制度的效應，德國<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年較前一年減少了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5000</span>萬噸、相當於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7%</span>的碳排量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">其中再生能源的部分，受風力條件良好和太陽能發電擴張的激勵，再生能源發電量首度超越燃煤火力發電和核電的總和，光風力、水力、太陽能和生質能等綠電即可滿足全國用電量的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">42.6%</span>，比前一年成長<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">為控制碳排的總量，歐盟實施碳交易制度，業者購買碳權才能排放二氧化碳。由於碳權交易價格近年居高不下，許多燃煤火力發電廠為了避免虧損只好降載或停機，導致去年褐煤的發電量減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">22%</span>，煙煤的發電量減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">31%</span>，反之碳排量較少的天然氣發電量增加了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">11%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">總計德國電力部門的碳排量在去年降低了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">18%</span>，連續第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>年下滑。全國碳排量與京都議定書基準年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1990</span>年相比降幅達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">35%</span>，離<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40%</span>的目標又更近一步。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">儘管電力部門減碳的成績高過預期，該智庫警告，建築和交通部門的碳排在去年不減反增，例如高碳排休旅車的熱賣，抵銷了電力部門減碳的成果。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">因此，該智庫建議，未來幾年，德國必須繼續擴充再生能源的裝置容量，才能彌補在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2022</span>年廢核後的電力缺口，並提供足夠的綠電給電動車和供應暖氣的熱汞使用，以減少交通和建築部門的碳排。（編輯：馮昭）<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1090108</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://www.cna.com.tw/news/aopl/202001080017.aspx</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-01-09","clk_count":"197"}},"__N_SSG":true}